Cell["\<\
The line above is formal unless every requested rho is installed. For \
numerical work, use the Numeric* functions. Perturbative rho is installed \
automatically; G2 and the standard single-line G3 term are evaluated as \
direct Borel moments.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"32da5ace-f7f4-4cea-9880-f1ea3df59c58"],

